OL,4,G1300FKey Changes: Radio 3's Essential
OL,5,     FHistory of Classical Music
OL,6,     GThe year is 1026. Monk Guido
OL,7,     Gd'Arezzo causes a musical
OL,8,     Grevolution with a new invention.
OL,9,G1400FRecord Review
OL,10,     GAndrew McGregor with the week's
OL,11,     Gbest new classical releases, plus
OL,12,     Gnews and recommendations.
OL,13,G1600FSound of Cinema
OL,14,     GEdith Bowman presents a weekly
OL,15,     Gcompendium of distinguished film
OL,16,     Gscores and soundtrack
OL,17,     Gcompositions - joined this week
OL,18,     Gby composers Sheridan Tongue and
OL,19,     GKathryn Tickell.
OL,20,G1700FThis Classical Life
OL,21,     GJess Gillam swaps favourite music
OL,22,     Gwith film composer David Arnold.
