OL,4,G2230FNew Music Show
OL,5,     GThe world premiere of British
OL,6,     Gcomposer Tansy Davies's The
OL,7,     GPassion of Mary Magdalene,
OL,8,     Grecorded at the Barbican in
OL,9,     GLondon with the Dunedin Consort.
OL,10,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,11,     GSofi Jeannin directs the
OL,12,     GCopenhagen choir in a programme
OL,13,     Gexploring Eastertide themes of
OL,14,     Gsorrow and comfort, spanning
OL,15,     Gcenturies of liturgical music.
OL,16,     GJohn Shea presents.
